                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-amber-100/70 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-amber-300">
                    <label class="block text-sm font-bold text-wood mb-1">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-school"></i> Kelas / Nama Tim / Sekolah
